{"exit":106,"name":"auth_failed","meaning":"the provider rejected the API key, or no key was found anywhere in the resolution chain","scripting":"missing-key exits are silent; rejections emit a stderr envelope (type AuthFailed) — provide a key via --api-key, the provider env var, config.json, or TAU_API_KEY","docs":"https://github.com/javimosch/tau/blob/master/docs/exit-codes.md"}
